{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54163","headline":"题招提院静照堂 · 张贲","name":"题招提院静照堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缾锡爲生久，门阑过客疎。\n於闲见真寂，燕坐此清虚。\n事事皆身外，悠悠度岁余。\n如何繁草木，还长旧庭除。\n（见《至元嘉禾志》卷三二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张贲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54163.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54163","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}